  <item>
    <title>vol16 老友记群居VS独居生活，哪个才是都市丽人的精神乐园？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b7a0d45680f4d4a82d42d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64b7a0d45680f4d4a82d42d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jul 2023 08:37:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Recently，老王搬进了一个"大家庭"，掉漆开启了人生初次独居体验。独居and与朋友同居，哪个体验更好嘞？今天来聊聊我们最近的生活新体验~</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊点什么：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 独居第一天就爽翻了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 再也不用受“印度冰箱”之苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 群居生活——一种新形式的学习小组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 都市力人化身都市丽人，一整个由俭入奢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 当猿人被驯化成文明人，还是有点不耐受的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 同居就总有一天要直面人类的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> 独居的弊端：原来我曾经只是表演型自律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> “与朋友同住“和“与同事合租”之大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 一个“幸福的家庭”可能总有一个人在视而不见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2626">43:46</a> 关于“有个伴儿”的一点思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日主角：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@掉漆了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>@原来是老王</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日剪辑：享受自在独居生活的掉漆</span></p>]]></description>
